{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Unique Tower Defense + RPG Dual perspectives Gameplay:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third - person (Tower Defense view) : Players can automatic attacks, build defense towers, and observe the movement routes of monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First - person (RPG view) : This perspective increases the player's basic attack power and enables them to cast skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428120/extras/9d4a68abf322b6331e2164ddb41b10f3.poster.avif?t=1750363584\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428120/extras/9d4a68abf322b6331e2164ddb41b10f3.webm?t=1750363584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Diverse Qimen Mechanisms</strong>:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jing(\u666f)</strong>: It can alter the terrain, thus changing the monsters' advancing paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428120/extras/543104b23ec0d753862d308947abdb2d.poster.avif?t=1750363584\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428120/extras/543104b23ec0d753862d308947abdb2d.webm?t=1750363584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shang(\u4f24)</strong>: It can destroy the monsters'  base, halting the progress of one group of monsters.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428120/extras/9e0bebb08c6c07da3c0a8abde9ab0d53.poster.avif?t=1750363584\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428120/extras/9e0bebb08c6c07da3c0a8abde9ab0d53.webm?t=1750363584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kai(\u5f00)</strong>: It can move the base of the defense tower, achieving the effect of assisting in defense.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428120/extras/c543702aeedbbc0e1ba2c59c4e229da8.poster.avif?t=1750363584\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428120/extras/c543702aeedbbc0e1ba2c59c4e229da8.webm?t=1750363584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also other Qimen mechanisms waiting for you to explore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Abundant Character Upgrade and Enhancement Methods</strong>:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talent System: Based on the rewards from daytime or nighttime levels, players can obtain different enhancement directions for either the defense towers or the characters themselves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forging System: With three sets of weapons, players can enjoy a different gaming experience in each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemy System: It provides additional skill points or an opportunity to reselect talents.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3428120?t=1750363584","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428120/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=